sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Clinician (Browser)
    participant UI as React AnalyzePage
    participant API as FastAPI /api/v1/predict
    participant Gate as CXRGate (&tau;=0.83)
    participant Engine as InferenceEngine
    participant DB as SQLite / SQLAlchemy

    User->>UI: Selects Patient & Uploads CXR Image
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/predict (Multipart Form)
    API->>Gate: validate(image_bytes)

    alt Image Fails CXR Validation (Non-CXR / Photo / CT / Corrupted)
        Gate-->>API: (is_cxr=False, score < 0.83, reason)
        Note over API: Model D, Grad-CAM & DB Insert Bypassed
        API-->>UI: HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity (INVALID_CXR)
        UI-->>User: Displays Amber Clinical Advisory Card
    else Image Validated as Plausible Chest Radiograph
        Gate-->>API: (is_cxr=True, score &ge; 0.83, "Passed")
        API->>Engine: predict(image_bytes, generate_gradcam=True)
        Note over Engine: Preprocessing: CLAHE + Gaussian LP (&sigma;=1.0)
        Note over Engine: DenseNet-121 Forward Pass -> 6-Class Softmax
        Note over Engine: Grad-CAM Feature Map Backpropagation
        Engine-->>API: Diagnostic Dict (Class, Conf, Probs, Heatmap)
        API->>DB: INSERT INTO lung_scans & predictions
        DB-->>API: Transaction Committed (scan_id, pred_id)
        API-->>UI: HTTP 200 OK (PredictionResponse JSON)
        UI-->>User: Renders 6-Class Probability Bar, Triage Alert & Heatmap
    end
